I am in the office.
It is Friday.
The office is very quiet today.
I am typing on my laptop.
My colleague Jonas sits opposite.
We are both working quietly.
I look out of the large window.
The sky is dark grey.
It is still raining.
Jonas is reading the news on the internet.
He looks up and smiles.
"Maya, the weather forecast is good," Jonas says.
"Really?" I ask.
"Yes, it will not rain anymore this afternoon," he answers.
He points at his screen.
"The clouds are disappearing," he says.
"And it will be sunny."
Outside it is still cold right now.
But I am looking forward to the sun.
I quickly continue working.
